menu "DreamGuardian Voice Debug"

config DEBUG_AUDIO_CAPTURE
    bool "Enable debug audio capture to WAV"
    default n
    help
        Capture raw microphone PCM and AFE output PCM into PSRAM, then write
        16 kHz mono signed 16-bit WAV files from a low-priority writer task.
        The real-time audio feed/fetch tasks only copy samples into memory.

endmenu
